  "prefLabel": "Frl 602.10 Documentation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Frl 602.10 Documentation.\n\n(a) A funeral home shall retain and offer for review all documentation stipulated by the Federal Trade Commission and 16 CFR 453.6. Said documentation shall be maintained in compliance with the rules set forth by the Federal Trade Commission and 16 CFR 453.6.\n\n(b) Any funeral chapel or location operating as a separate facility directly associated with a funeral home shall offer for review to consumers all documentation required by the Federal Trade Commission and 16 CFR 453.6, and shall include the legal name, address, and phone number of all locations affiliated with the funeral home.\n\n(c) All services and associated costs offered to the consumer by a funeral chapel or location operating in direct association with a funeral home shall be the same as those being offered by the primary funeral home.\n\n(d) All websites directly related to a funeral home or funeral chapel shall be maintained with current documentation and information associated with the funeral home, funeral chapel, or location, and said documentation shall be in compliance with the rules set forth by the Federal Trade Commission and 16 CFR 453.6.\n\nSource. #1689, eff 12-22-80; ss by#2344, eff 4-15-83; ss by #2986, eff 3-18-85; ss by #4357, eff 1-20-88, EXPIRED: 1-20-94\n\nNew. #10988, eff 12-7-15; ss by #14646, eff 9-4-26, EXPIRES: 9-4-36 (formerly Frl 602.13)",
